<!--
    Veil's mark, matching the desktop build: a disc behind horizontal slits.

    The slits are empty, not white: whatever is behind the icon shows through
    them, which is why the background layer is transparent.

    Drawn as the three pieces the slits leave, so each follows the disc's own
    arc and the slits meet the edge exactly — see the status bar copy for why a
    punched-out bar cannot.

    The desktop's proportions on the 72dp a launcher promises to show.
-->
